      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pose onto a cleaned photo\n\n1. Ask Gemini to remove the person from the reference and keep the background.\n2. Load that result in EMPTY BACKGROUND. Load the original in REFERENCE PHOTO. The original is only used for the pose.\n3. NEW CHARACTER is generated in that pose, masked, and stitched onto the empty background.\n\nThe Gemini image has to be the same photo and the same framing, with the person gone. If the new person sits in the wrong place, the framing changed."
      ]
    }
